<section id="systems">
  <div class="section-label">
    <span class="sec-num">§ II</span>Current Systems · Active Infrastructure
  </div>
  <h2 class="sec-h2 reveal">Active<br><em>Infrastructure</em></h2>
  <p class="body-text reveal" style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">Two nodes are currently running, plus this hub itself — where research, essays and the technical record live. Each is a distinct system with its own architecture, purpose and audience — connected by a shared philosophy of building things that persist.</p>

  <div class="reveal">
    <div class="sys-entry">
      <div class="sys-entry-header">
        <div class="sys-index">SYS::01</div>
        <div class="sys-name"><img class="sys-icon" src="/images/cognituum/cognituum_icon.png" alt="Cognituum logo" />Cognituum</div>
        <div class="sys-status">Active Research</div>
      </div>
      <div class="sys-sub">A Cognitive State Continuum Infrastructure</div>
      <p class="sys-body">Most AI tooling today is episodic — each session starts over, and context, intent and institutional knowledge get lost between tools, sessions and providers. Cognituum is my ongoing research initiative into cognitive continuity: how systems can preserve context and intent instead of losing them. Output is a whitepaper / framework specification, in progress, intended as a foundation for future standards, protocols or product implementations.</p>
      <div class="sys-tags">
        <span class="sys-tag">Continuity</span>
        <span class="sys-tag">Provider-Agnostic</span>
        <span class="sys-tag">Local Knowledge</span>
        <span class="sys-tag">Whitepaper</span>
      </div>
      <div class="sys-links">
        <a href="https://josevigil.com/cognituum" class="sys-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Website →</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/cognituum" class="sys-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub →</a>
        <a href="/cognituum" class="sys-link">More info →</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="sys-entry">
      <div class="sys-entry-header">
        <div class="sys-index">SYS::02</div>
        <div class="sys-name"><img class="sys-icon" src="/images/bloomaut/bloomaut_icon.png" alt="Bloomaut logo" />Bloomaut</div>
        <div class="sys-status">Building · Active</div>
      </div>
      <div class="sys-sub">Human-Led Content Validation</div>
      <p class="sys-body">Co-founded with two other co-founders. A platform for human-led content generation and public building — helping entrepreneurs and creators validate content through peer feedback before publishing. Ongoing side project; planned as a future use case for Cognituum once implemented.</p>
      <div class="sys-tags">
        <span class="sys-tag">Content Validation</span>
        <span class="sys-tag">Community Feedback</span>
        <span class="sys-tag">Creator Tools</span>
      </div>
      <div class="sys-links">
        <a href="https://www.bloomaut.com/" class="sys-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Website →</a>
        <a href="/bloomaut" class="sys-link">More info →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</section>

